5	//! # TOON
6	//!
7	//! Token-Oriented Object Notation (TOON) renderer for michi and AXI.
8	//!
9	//! Output conforms to the TOON specification version 4.4 (`toon-spec: 4.4`,
10	//! <https://github.com/toon-format/spec>): a list document is a root object holding the list in tabular form
11	//! (`type[N]{f1,f2}:` plus one row per line), `type: []` when empty, an optional `totalCount: N` field and an optional
12	//! inline `help[N]: …` array, with no trailing newline.
13	
14	mod escape;
15	pub(crate) mod render;
16	
17	pub(crate) use escape::push_f64;
18	pub use escape::{escape_key, escape_value, escape_value_quoted};
