209	    /// Delegates to [`ToonDocument::validate`]. Validation is mandatory:
210	    /// rendering consumes the [`ToonDocument`] this returns, so there is no
211	    /// path from an unvalidated `ToonOptions` to rendered output.
212	    ///
213	    /// # Errors
214	    ///
215	    /// Returns [`ToonError::InvalidTypeName`] if `type_name` is a reserved
216	    /// root key (`totalCount`, `help`, `recovery` or `truncated`), [`ToonError::TooManyFields`] past [`MAX_FIELDS`] fields,
217	    /// [`ToonError::InvalidFieldName`] if a field name appears more than once, [`ToonError::TooManyCells`] if
